      <p>  <p>The integer constant CHANGED_RENDER_MATERIAL has the value 0x1000</p>
  <p>Prim <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_RENDER_MATERIAL" target="_blank">material ID</a> or <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/GLTF_Overrides" target="_blank">material overrides</a> have changed on one or more faces.</p>
</p>
